# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# Types:   feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scope:   the package or area touched — www, ui, otel, workflows, root
# Subject: imperative, lower case, no trailing period, <= 72 chars
#
# Body: what changed and why, not how. Wrap at 72.
# Footer: BREAKING CHANGE: <description>, or Closes #123
